{"full":"hf:OpenTogether/community-playlist","spaceId":"OpenTogether/community-playlist","name":"Community Playlist","source":"huggingface","description":"Open a real PR to the party soundtrack. Built together.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":null,"topics":["docker","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":4,"created":"2026-09-17T00:16:01.000Z","updated":"2026-10-15T03:49:40.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://opentogether-community-playlist.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/OpenTogether/community-playlist","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T16:56:41.365Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T16:56:41.365Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T16:56:41.365Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🎧","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A public playlist curated through real Hugging Face pull requests. Playlist data and PRs · Event","React/Vite frontend, FastAPI backend, CPU Basic, one worker and replica. Public Git data is the source of truth; no database, bucket, Spotify API, or service write token. Each contributor's OAuth token creates their own PRs and comments. Organizer login additionally checks current OpenTogether admin membership before every review action.","Organizer sign-in requests write-repos because HF requires repository write access to merge PRs. HF's scope includes personal repositories and selected organization repositories; the app only writes playlist changes to OpenTogether/community-playlist. Contributor sign-in requests only profile and discussion/PR permissions. No repository write scope is requested for ordinary contributions."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/OpenTogether/community-playlist/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a546953a79b24bbb811f2abcdb00d928ee6e55ab058c2770e660bbd5a2fcec70","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T16:56:41.392Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T16:56:41.392Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A public